  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed privacy screen together with the\r\nexternal raised rear patio, by reason of its substantial depth, height, siting\r\nand proximity to the shared boundary with No. 75 Gainsborough Gardens, would\r\nresult in actual and perceived overlooking, loss of privacy, and overbearing towards\r\nto the detriment of their residential amenities. The proposal is therefore contrary\r\nto the Policy DM1 of Harrow’s Development Management Policies Local Plan\r\ndocument (2013); Policy GR1 of Harrow’s Emerging Local Plan (2024); and\r\nHarrow’s Residential Design Guide SPD (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
